<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9650.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.9650.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.9650 against the dollar, down from 2.9400 on Tuesday, and at 1.8085 against the mark, up from 1.8135, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty at an average of 3.10 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, down from Tuesday's 3.38 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
